From: yzddmr6 <46088090+yzddmr6@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] va: add equal-size linear RGB to NV12 video processing

Implement only the VideoProc path needed for a DMA-BUF screen capture
feeding the existing H.264 encoder. Convert with GLES on a private worker;
reject scaling, cropping, filters, nonlinear imports and unsupported color
standards rather than silently changing the requested operation.

Source: qualcomm-iris-vaapi 4125b1190c66ff7cf46e54c2b6d4076a01d7d1cd
License: MIT
Co-Authored-By: gpt-6-astra <noreply@openai.com>

